      "answer": "The player's gold is already present in the server-loaded campaign state — no tool call is needed or appropriate here. It is **25 gold** (Eval Hero, Banner Spear, Level 1).\n\n---\n\nHere is every prosperity-1 item (001–016) with what you can and cannot afford on 25 gold:\n\n## ✅ Affordable (25g or less)\n\n| # | Name | Slot | Cost | Effect |\n|---|------|------|------|--------|\n| 001 | Weathered Boots | Legs | 15g | During your move ability, add *Move +1*. |\n| 002 | Winged Shoes | Legs | 15g | During your turn, add *Jump* to all your move abilities. |\n| 003 | Hide Armor | Body | 10g | On the next two sources of damage from attacks targeting you, gain *Shield 1* for the attacks. |\n| 004 | Leather Armor | Body | 10g | When you are attacked, before drawing a modifier card, the attacker gains *Disadvantage*. |\n| 005 | Scouting Lens | Head | 10g | During your attack ability, add *Pierce 1* to one attack. |\n| 006 | Amulet of Life | Head | 15g | During your turn, perform *Heal 1, Self*. |\n| 007 | Poison Dagger | One Hand | 15g | During your melee attack ability, add *Poison* to one attack. |\n| 008 | Heater Shield | One Hand | 15g | When you suffer damage from an attack, gain *Shield 1* for the attack. |\n| 009 | Focusing Rod | One Hand | 10g | During your turn, if you've performed an action with *Lost*, perform *Heal 1, Range 3*. |\n| 010 | Simple Bow | Two Hands | 15g | During your ranged attack ability, gain *Advantage* on one attack. |\n| 011 | Healing Potion | Small Item | 10g | During your turn, perform *Heal 3, Self*. |\n| 012 | Stamina Potion | Small Item | 10g | During your turn, recover one level 1 card from your discard pile. |\n| 013 | Element Potion | Small Item | 10g | During your turn, *Wild* (infuse a wild element). |\n\n## ❌ Too Expensive\n\n| # | Name | Slot | Cost | Effect |\n|---|------|------|------|--------|\n| 014 | Studded Leather | Body | 20g | Attacker gains *Disadvantage* + you gain *Shield 1* when attacked. |\n| 015 | Comfortable Shoes | Legs | 20g | Basic bottom move action becomes *Move 3* instead of *Move 2*. |\n| 016 | Circlet of Elements | Head | 20g | During your turn, infuse a *Wild* element. |\n\n---\n\n**You can afford items 001–013** (all cost 10–15g). Items 014–016 cost 20g each, which is under your 25g — wait, let me correct that: **20g is also under 25g**, so you can actually afford those too!\n\n✅ **You can afford all 16 items currently in the shop.** The most expensive are 014, 015, and 016 at 20g each, which is still within your 25g budget. You couldn't afford two items simultaneously if the combined cost exceeds 25g, but any single item is within reach.\n\n*Source: GHS Card Data, items 001–016; Rulebook p. 52 (prosperity level 1 unlocks items 001–016).*",
